title: Neo-Soul Song in B-flat
key: Bb
tempo: 84
style: neosoul

// An intro on the two-five, a verse on the one and the six, a chorus that
// opens on the four, a bridge that hangs on a suspended five, and an outro
// that borrows the minor four on its way home.
