| Cm9 | F13 | Bbmaj9 | % |

[Verse]
| Bbmaj9 | Gm9 | Cm9 | F13 |
| Bbmaj9 | Gm9 | Cm9 | F13 |

[Chorus]
| Ebmaj9 | Dm9 | Gm9 | Cm9 F13 |
| Ebmaj9 | Dm9 | Gm9 | Cm9 F13 |

[Verse]

[Chorus]

[Bridge]
| Gm9 | Ebmaj9 | Cm9 | F7sus4 |
| Gm9 | Ebmaj9 | Cm9 | F7sus4 |

[Chorus]

[Outro]
| Ebmaj9 | Ebm9 | Bbmaj9 | % |

